@startuml commit_addition_limit
' Source evidence: .github/workflows/ci.yml:3-41, jobs.build.steps at 09b32d8ea4a4b43b34be302d8b2745bdc417c9a2.
' Source evidence: scripts/check-commit-additions.sh:6,53-132, MAX_ADDED_LINES and check_pull_request at the same baseline.
' Observed behavior: the baseline runs an addition gate before mirror layout and build checks.
' Target architecture: remove the addition gate and its dedicated tests; preserve other CI steps.
' Design reason: complete features and their tests should not be split solely to satisfy a line budget.
title CI validation without an addition budget

start
:Pull request or main push;
:Checkout repository;
:Check CampusClaw mirror layout;
:Set up JDK 21;
:Run Spotless check;
:Run Maven verify;
:Report build result;
stop
@enduml
